{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1761841,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":"blue_un","paid":0,"title":"Vihaan X: Software Track","festival_id":519244,"organization_id":306,"web_url":"vihaan.ieeedtu.in","start_date":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-11-15T17:00:00+05:30","location":null,"type":"hackathons","public_url":"hackathons\/vihaan-x-software-track-dtu-new-delhi-1761841","region":"offline","details":"<p><strong>About the Competition<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Vihaan X is North India's largest student-run hackathon, organised by IEEE DTU.<\/li>\n<li>The Software Track is a celebration of innovation through code, where participants collaborate to build impactful digital solutions in an intense 24-hour window.<\/li>\n<li>The format is structured as 8 hours of coding, 8 hours of building, and 8 hours of debugging &mdash; pushing teams to turn ideas into fully functional applications.<\/li>\n<li>From AI-powered platforms and full-stack web apps to mobile and system-level solutions, this track is where ambitious builders ship real products, not just prototypes.<\/li>\n<li>Teams design scalable, user-centric solutions while getting mentored by industry experts throughout the event.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Software Track Domains<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>HealthTech<\/li>\n<li>FinTech<\/li>\n<li>Education<\/li>\n<li>Web3 &amp; Blockchain<\/li>\n<li>E-Sports<\/li>\n<li>Women's Safety<\/li>\n<li>Security<\/li>\n<li>Sustainability<\/li>\n<li>Open Innovation<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Team Size<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Maximum of 4 participants per team.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Rounds:&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Day 1:<\/strong>&nbsp;Building and developing projects, from core features to a working prototype<\/li>\n<li><strong>Day 2 (around 10 AM):<\/strong> Project evaluation and judging<\/li>\n<li><strong>Final Round:<\/strong> Shortlisted teams present to industry experts<\/li>\n<li>Winners are announced after final presentations<